[{"title":"次韵赠方员岩山人","author":"方孝孺","text":"到处清泉可洗心，禅机一指用功深。\n任教东住复西住，不改乡音与梵音。\n见客喜为青眼顾，能诗懒效白头吟。\n近来识面峨眉上，萝月松云得共寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58172,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵兄调弟希政并柬郑叔度 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"百年乔木阴当户，五亩幽居水映茅。\n好古喜寻遗老问，避喧懒与贵人交。\n从兄受学惭苏辙，与弟分财笑薛包。\n孝友传家得无愧，聚蚊免使退之嘲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58173,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵兄调弟希政并柬郑叔度 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"乡闾儒术许谁加，弟唱兄酬兴未赊。\n经济有心惭薄德，安居无事任贫家。\n日高瓮牖蜂穿纸，潮落江汀雁聚沙。\n却叹离居趋侍日，时来相对卜灯花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58174,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽徐节妇","author":"方孝孺","text":"大节寥寥不可闻，晚从吾郡始知真。\n百年礼乐无男子，一日干戈有妇人。\n波冷曹娥沉白骨，雨荒剡岭洗红尘。\n争如烈焰三千丈，高照青编万古春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58175,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠韩敏道先生赴召","author":"方孝孺","text":"先生乐道慕前人，又被书徵觐紫宸。\n诗卷巳随官棹月，布衣还染属车尘。\n文章共喜遭逢晚，礼乐应知入问频。\n登眺凤台多制作，邮筒珍重寄河滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58176,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵留别陈季明先生 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"太丘美政汉称贤，高节英风四海传。\n垂白云孙今几叶，汗青甲子巳千年。\n盍簪重见星垂象，落笔犹惊地涌泉。\n耻以文章为世用，懒将辞色向人妍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58177,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵留别陈季明先生 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"每怀海上三秋别，来借山中一榻眠。\n妙论久容亲讲席，深杯相劝惜离筵。\n时清共喜闲身健，情重翻令别意绵。\n他日朝廷访遗老，吹嘘拟进白云篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58178,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯木图寄许士修","author":"方孝孺","text":"春到巳多时，幽禽尚未知。\n上林无限好，何事立枯枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58179,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虎图","author":"方孝孺","text":"踊跃谷生风，峥嵘百兽中。\n岂知王者瑞，足不履生虫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58180,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"欲向匡庐隐，出门知路难。\n江山奇绝处，多在画图看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58181,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题山水 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"离家今几载，衣?染京尘。\n不敢看图画，青山恐笑人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58182,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题曹娥江","author":"方孝孺","text":"娥以孝而死，江因娥得名。\n至今潮上落，犹带哭爷声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58183,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹月图送太学生归省","author":"方孝孺","text":"黄金台上月，照尔忆亲情。\n归去供甘旨，春林笋正生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58184,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中除夕 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"数漏掩残历，中宵气候殊。\n独怜愁共病，不与岁同除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58185,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中除夕 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"三十知未老，巳难同少年。\n功名谢时辈，心事愧前贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58186,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中除夕 其三","author":"方孝孺","text":"里巷占新岁，皆云胜旧年。\n几回新岁过，万事只如前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58187,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中除夕 其四","author":"方孝孺","text":"良医难治病，学道不能行。\n疟疾何须患，吾心病未轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58188,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"方孝孺","text":"茅屋东屿西屿，白云前山后山。\n为报溪头流水，落花休出人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58189,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牧牛图","author":"方孝孺","text":"谷口惊湍雨歇，柳阴芳草春还。\n试问太平乐事，夕阳牛背青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58190,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉试灵芝甘露论","author":"方孝孺","text":"汉家图治策贤良，董子昌言日月光。\n自笑腐儒千载后，却劳圣主试文章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58191,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试院偶题 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"柳影波光锁院深，一尘不到市声沉。\n多情惟有双灵鹊，时到庭前送好音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58192,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试院偶题 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"三代宾兴法尚存，每因取士叹斯文。\n近来眼病无聊甚，岂复能空冀北群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58193,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"试院偶题 其三","author":"方孝孺","text":"桥门冠盖蔼如云，才气争先总出群。\n自愧腐儒无一艺，强颜来此较斯文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58194,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵谢蜀王六首 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"恩命许辞金殿直，归装仍赐石渠书。\n欲知怀德无穷意，长望星辰想属车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58195,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵谢蜀王六首 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"志是子渊方是广，才如曾点始为狂。\n自惭末学何为者，孤负恩言鬓欲苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58196,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵谢蜀王六首 其三","author":"方孝孺","text":"幸瞻天下难逢德，又读人间未见书。\n魂梦何尝违禁闼，深恩安敢忘巾车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58197,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵谢蜀王六首 其四","author":"方孝孺","text":"德尊待士真忘势，位下忧民每悔狂。\n明日岷峨应渐远，莫云回首看青苍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58198,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵谢蜀王六首 其五","author":"方孝孺","text":"全德巳看承道统，雄才更复主诗盟。\n欲知圣敬心无息，顾諟参前与倚衡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58199,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵谢蜀王六首 其六","author":"方孝孺","text":"德胜东平弟与兄，共誇乐国似蓬瀛。\n近闻传令安黎庶，欢动山南十万兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58200,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍世子奉献蜀王十首 其一","author":"方孝孺","text":"贤君德业本天成，犹待脩心道益明。\n喜见储王亲笔砚，更须讲学近儒臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58201,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍世子奉献蜀王十首 其二","author":"方孝孺","text":"昧爽先求问寝衣，三朝日日礼无遗。\n古来世子能敦孝，惟有文王最可师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58202,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍世子奉献蜀王十首 其三","author":"方孝孺","text":"祖训昭昭日月新，由来治国本天伦。\n令名要使传千载，仁政须教及万民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58203,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍世子奉献蜀王十首 其四","author":"方孝孺","text":"炫日辉霞锦价高，制成称体小龙袍。\n试看黼黻文章美，须念?桑杼轴劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58204,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍世子奉献蜀王十首 其五","author":"方孝孺","text":"金匙磲盌绛纱笼，玉瑩珠圆颗颗同。\n愿采豳风歌七月，要知稼穑重三农。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58205,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍世子奉献蜀王十首 其六","author":"方孝孺","text":"农事艰难古所怜，一生几度遇丰年。\n若非圣世轻租税，逐末何人肯力田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58206,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍世子奉献蜀王十首 其七","author":"方孝孺","text":"九经治国本脩身，身正方能鉴别人。\n辩佞要知驽异骥，任贤莫指玉为珉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":58207,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"侍世子奉献蜀王十首 其八","author":"方孝孺","text":"君王待士古来无，令德高名满八区。\n济美喜看贤世子，巳能端拱礼诸儒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Po